       that says nothing about what a swap actually pays out, where a 1-3%
       spread, a flat network fee and per-pair min/max limits all bite. This
       node asks a real bridge for a quote on a concrete amount and emits it
       every tick. A PnHttp subclass in core with a -gui companion, mirroring
       PnRate; no PnNodeClass vfunc added, so no plugin ABI bump. Two providers
       in v1, selected by a `bridge` enum so two nodes can compare the same pair
       side by side on one graph. Currencies reuse PN_TYPE_CURRENCY, so the
