             per-output last-value readout, pn_node_emit_message_on_output()
             + pn_node_current_output() (thread-local, saved/restored like
             current_input). pn_node_emit_message() == output 0. The stacked
             port section is max(multi-in rows, multi-out rows). No ABI bump
             (instance-private state + new functions only).
